      "content": "thanks for this. it looks pretty professional and definitely doesn't sound like a robot wrote it, which is good.\n\nthe only thing is... i just ran it through the simulator and my impact score was actually pretty low. like, way lower than the passing threshold. i think it's because i didn't use enough of those \"power words\" the engine looks for.\n\ncan we try one more version? i still want it to be professional and not sound like total spam, but can we beef up the impact a bit? maybe try to weave in more strong descriptors so i can actually get a passing score this time? just try to make it sound more \"high-impact\" without making it look like we're just throwing adjectives at a wall.",
